Verse 1:
[Eb/G]Glory be to the [Ab]Father,
[Fm]and [Bb/F]to [Gm/Bb]the [Bb]Son,
[Bb]and to [Am]the [Bb]Holy Ghost;
[Gm]As [Eb]it [Ab]was [Bb/F]in [Fm]the beginning,
[Bb7]is now, [Eb/Bb]and [Bb]ever shall be,
[Eb/Bb]world without [Ab]end.
[Cm/G]A-men, A--men.
